&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;deps:&lt;/strong&gt; update rolldown-related dependencies (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23483&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vitejs/vite/pull/23483/hovercard&quot;&gt;#23483&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/9aecbbfa5fb5da4b9981c099cb9746a9fd210806&quot;&gt;9aecbbf&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
